  "description": "Lately, someone has been watching me. From my father’s mysterious death to a neighbor who’s getting on my nerves— for Kwon Seon-Gyeom, a detective, every day is filled with nothing but unpleasant incidents. Then one day, on his way home, he discovers a photograph lying on the ground. Then two, then three... Countless photos, too many to count. The path led to the house of his neighbor, Yeo U-Won. As if spellbound, Seon-Gyeom entered the house and witnessed a shocking scene... \n\n*“Hyung, you really don’t recognize me?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
